notes:
Can be used on the small boat south-west in the [[Isle of Ada]], {{Mapper Coords|132.39|125.232|7|4|text=here}}, for a chance to get teleported to the small boat north of the isle, {{Mapper Coords|132.109|125.106|7|4|text=here}}.

It is not guaranteed to succeed, and might require a few tries. The item does not disappear when used.
* when failing: {{Server Message|You were not able to fix the boat with the repair kit and the few spare parts it came with.}}
* when suceeding: {{Server Message|You manage to repair the boat using the kit. The small boat is sturdy enough to sail around the reef and towards a tiny bay at the back of the isle.}}
